{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_01",
      "hash": "4922a821543180a8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：啊，\\n我说，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_02",
      "hash": "4922ab21543185c1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那边的门好像走不了啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_03",
      "hash": "4922aa215431840e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不过只要穿过[VAR COLOR(0006)]地下通道[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\n就能到达[VAR COLOR(0006)]枯叶市[VAR COLOR(0000)]了！\\c\\n虽说里面光线太昏暗了，\\n有点那啥。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_04",
      "hash": "4922ad2154318927",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_05",
      "hash": "4922ac2154318774",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n你先别动……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_06",
      "hash": "4922af2154318c8d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我就觉得有什么东西\\n闪闪发亮呢，\\c\\n仔细一看，\\n原来是你头发上粘着这个东西啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0355_sys_01",
      "hash": "c60b529203635a3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那里\\n得到了活力碎片！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_07",
      "hash": "4922ae2154318ada",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "活力碎片可以帮助\\n濒死的宝可梦回复活力！\\c\\n我身上也带着几个的……\\n就把我的也分给你一些吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0355_sys_02",
      "hash": "c60b539203635bf2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那里\\n得到了２个活力碎片！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_08",
      "hash": "4922a121543174c3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "也许这些能在你挑战\\n下一个道馆时帮到你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_09",
      "hash": "4922a02154317310",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……嗯？你拿着的那个，\\n该不会是船票吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0355_select_01",
      "hash": "2fd0a1f98fff99a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "给你１张！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0355_select_02",
      "hash": "2fd0a4f98fff9eb9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "多出来１张。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_14",
      "hash": "491f1f21542e6206",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊～真好啊！\\n而且居然是圣特安努号吗！？\\c\\n那可是环游了世界各地，\\n拥有极高知名度的豪华游轮呐！\\c\\n哪怕只是一次也好，\\n我真想坐坐看这艘游轮啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0355_player_01",
      "hash": "63a16bd38951be9b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0355_sys_03",
      "hash": "c60b549203635da5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把１张船票\\n交给了[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_10",
      "hash": "491f2321542e68d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇！真的可以送我吗？\\n我一定会去的！\\r\\n话说，你怎么会有这个？"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_11",
      "hash": "491f2421542e6a85",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什么！你说这是\\n那个会说话的宝可梦送你的！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_12",
      "hash": "491f2121542e656c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦哦，是这样啊。\\n原来他是实打实的人类啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_13",
      "hash": "491f2221542e671f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……就请你忘了\\n那个时候发生的事吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0355_rival_15",
      "hash": "491f2021542e63b9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了，\\n我要继续前进了！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0355_max",
      "hash": "c5665a8bfdae069c"
    }
  ]
}
